      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "and we write $ u \\sim \\chi_{n,\\lambda}^{2} $. As shown in Figure A5.3, increasing the noncentrality parameter $ \\lambda $ shifts the distribution to the right. This is also seen by considering the mean and variance of u,",
